OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced over post
OL,4,Athreatening Lucy Connolly
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been given a 12-month
OL,7,Fcommunity order after leaving a
OL,8,Fthreatening Facebook comment about Lucy
OL,9,FConnolly, who was jailed for stirring
OL,10,Fup racial hatred.
OL,12,FJake Newman, 35, from Kingsley Road,
OL,13,FNorthampton, pleaded guilty to sending
OL,14,Fa communication threatening death or
OL,15,Fserious harm when he wrote: "Time to
OL,16,Ftreat her house the way she wanted
OL,17,Fhotels treated, just make sure she's in
OL,18,Fit and not able to get out."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
