OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced over post
OL,4,Athreatening Lucy Connolly
OL,5,
OL,6,FConnolly was jailed in 2024 after she
OL,7,Fcalled for people to "set fire" to
OL,8,Fhotels housing asylum seekers in the
OL,9,Fwake of the Southport attack, where
OL,10,Fthree girls were murdered and others
OL,11,Finjured.
OL,13,FAt his sentencing on Thursday at
OL,14,FBirmingham Crown Court, Judge Smith
OL,15,Ftold Newman he had committed a
OL,16,F"dangerous, potentially very risky
OL,17,Fcriminal act".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
